 be possible  here but if you see our mate Dave  playing online jump in and give him a  hand  tactically this will give the game  additional depth and replayability  hopefully if you choose to play this way  you and your BFF will fill the shoes of  newly appointed deputy sheriff sent to  arrest Eden gates leader father Joseph  and you can guess how well or how badly  that will go the body system from Far  Cry 4 returns in Far Cry 5 in the shape  of the guns for higher mechanic in the  level we played we had access to boomer  a loyal dog who can mark and take down  enemies and even unarmed foes and bring  the weapons back to you  there's also Nick Rai a family man who  has had enough of the cult and decides  to combine his love of aviation and  weaponry to take a stand against the  combining of the church and state and  we've also seen great who is a trained  sniper perfect for covert missions for  those moments where blowing everything  up isn't an option in addition to these  three companions there will be other  important character steering us through  the mayhem such as Mary May a local  saloon owner ready to mix a few Molotov  cocktails hold on a sec her  establishment is called the whistling  beaver I'm nice I didn't see that one  coming we'll also meet pastor Jerome  Jeffries a preacher whose patrons have  been led astray by the cult wall to the  man who leads my flock astray  if I am NOT THERE shown then I must be  the wolf  on top of this is a fangs for higher  function which was introduced during Far  Cry primal here we can command animals  to support whichever play style we want  the animals around hop County won't be  as varied as in Far Cry primal but they  will be useful nonetheless the one thing  that the Far Cry series is renowned for  is its leading villains somehow making a  madman seem logical  did I ever tell you the definition of  insanity and even making a tyrannical  dictator look like the good guides me  Far Cry fives head villain father Joseph  seed who is simultaneously deranged and  charismatic as he forces his religious  beliefs onto others Joseph's siblings  make up his apostles or lieutenants if  you prefer which will act as sub bosses  as you tear apart ol County looking for  clues and generally ruining Joseph's day  will father Joseph be on the same level  as vast or pagan min time will tell but  unlike the chosen one sent before God  will never let you take me far cry 5 is  a vast world to get around in and like  previous installments vehicles will be  pivotal from getting A to B like you'd  expect there's a plethora of road  vehicles to use and the fair amount of  boats - but it's the plains which have  evolved here  although Far Cry 4 had a small aircraft  to get around in it was pretty pathetic  here in Hope County airplanes have taken  center stage  prepare for dogfights with the chosen  and the obligatory carpet bombing of the  gods  look at that go sometimes disrupting a  doomsday cults and murdering hundreds of  foals takes its toll on us and we need  some rest and relaxation far cry we'll  have a few extracurricular activities  for us to enjoy recreate daredevil races  against time like Evel Knievel hunt down  the local wildlife and even go fishing  there's something about fishing in video  games that we just cannot ignore  we're so sophisticated whoever catches  the biggest fish will be forever known  as the Codfather it's suffering sorry  I'll scale down those fish puns far cry  5 has adapted the fighting system in  previous iterations to allow for more  close up and personal melee focused  action dozens of new animations have  been added to give you the option of  running in swinging if that suits your  play style so hopefully it will feel a  little less like Skyrim this time around  when scrapping in close range  a really interesting update to Far Cry 5  is the resistance meter this mechanic  takes note of all your dirty deeds and  reacts to them for example if you  disrupt jaws its 